# =============================================================================
# codingame-csb-physics — comprehensive .gitignore
# Header-only C++ physics + Python verification harness + battle JSON corpus
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled / local binaries (always rebuild; never commit)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# g++ / clang outputs for the replay driver and any ad-hoc tools
physics/replay_driver
physics/replay_driver.exe
**/replay_driver
!physics/replay_driver.cpp

